{"5040970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magic Shop Chaos", "steam_appid": 5040970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Order to the Chaos</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a huge magic shop covered in a massive pile of 6,000 weapons, potions, and magic items. Play as witches, work together, and turn this giant mess into a clean, tidy store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sort Items and Serve Customers</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through giant piles of glowing swords, scythes, potions, witch hats, and gems. Find where each item belongs and put it back on the shelf. But watch out, because customers will visit the shop wanting to buy things. Work with your team to keep the store organized while serving buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Magic Skills</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean up, you earn experience to unlock helpful witch abilities. Learn spells that highlight matching items, pull objects straight into your hands, or make you move much faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Co-op Fun</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up tasks with your friends or just dive into the chaos together. Enjoy the super satisfying feeling of watching the messy floor clear up, item by item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Order to the Chaos</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a huge magic shop covered in a massive pile of 6,000 weapons, potions, and magic items. Play as witches, work together, and turn this giant mess into a clean, tidy store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/70d96c0873903a21aed10fc995404459.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sort Items and Serve Customers</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig through giant piles of glowing swords, scythes, potions, witch hats, and gems. Find where each item belongs and put it back on the shelf. But watch out, because customers will visit the shop wanting to buy things. Work with your team to keep the store organized while serving buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/caad1884b5fdbc12c53f04013d55f15b.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Magic Skills</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean up, you earn experience to unlock helpful witch abilities. Learn spells that highlight matching items, pull objects straight into your hands, or make you move much faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/8daf60043d58b058c708c219fa0aefa4.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing Co-op Fun</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divide up tasks with your friends or just dive into the chaos together. Enjoy the super satisfying feeling of watching the messy floor clear up, item by item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.poster.avif?t=1787914527\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.webm?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040970/extras/a91fb96fdedb9bdef70ba903c5c6b6b3.mp4?t=1787914527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A fun co-op organization simulator for 1-4 players. Team up as witches to bring order to a chaotic shop 